~ Q1
if Q1.claimed:
	if Q1.Qcompleted:
		if Q1.q1_ended == false:
			Sam: Wow here is you 10 coins!
			set Global.Coin += 10
			set Q1.q1_ended = true
	else:
		Sam: Come back then the quest is finished!
else:
	Sam: Hello there!
	You: Do you have a quest for me?
	Sam: Yes I do if you kill a red enemy I will give you 10 coins.
	- Start quest
		Sam: Well you better get the job done!
		set Q1.claimed = true
	- Leave => END
=> END